# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Yeatru Sourcing — 301 Redirects (SEO cleanup 2026-09-13)
# Fixes 249 404 URLs from Google Search Console
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1) Domain canonicalization (kept from original)
yeatru.com/*                https://www.yeatru.com/:splat        301
yeatru.github.io/*          https://www.yeatru.com/:splat        301
*.pages.dev/*               https://www.yeatru.com/:splat        301

# 2) OLD product URL patterns → /all-products.html catalog
#    GSC shows: product-YS-CL-S01A.html, product-YS-HD-2008S.html
/product-YS-*               /all-products.html                   301

# 3) OLD numeric product IDs → /all-products.html  
#    GSC shows: product-1781938167021.html, product-368.html
/product-[0-9]*.html        /all-products.html                   301

# 4) OLD catalog query string patterns
#    products.html?product=XXX → individual product page or catalog
/products.html?*product=*   /all-products.html                   301

# 5) OLD blog slugs that were renamed
/blog-seasonal-sourcing.html    /blog.html                   301
/blog-negotiation-strategies.html /blog.html                 301
/blog-import-compliance.html     /blog-product-certifications.html  301


# 5) Strip ?lang=XX query params (handled via JavaScript 404.html too)
#    Cloudflare can't do query-param stripping natively in _redirects
#    So we handle this client-side

# 6) Strip version query params ?v=XXXXX (same as above, handled via JS)
